Package: overlay2-initramfs
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, initramfs-tools, cryptsetup, openssl, util-linux, gawk | mawk
Description: Custom initramfs boot script with OverlayFS, LUKS detached headers and OpenSSL
 POSIX-compliant initramfs-tools boot script implementing Live root mount
 using OverlayFS with persistence (RAM, storage, loop), LUKS detached headers,
 and AES-256-CTR OpenSSL header encryption.
